On top of that, we taped two
Cascade Lake CPUs from Intel

00:09:06.340 --> 00:09:11.840
with 96 vCPUs and up to
1.3 terabytes of memory.

00:09:11.840 --> 00:09:15.480
This is really important
because two reasons.

00:09:15.480 --> 00:09:19.820
One, some customers come to us
whether it be financial or ML

00:09:19.820 --> 00:09:24.630
or science and saying, I just
have too big of a data set.

00:09:24.630 --> 00:09:26.515
My GPU power I need
