VM for big memory size.

00:09:30.400 --> 00:09:34.930
So one, the memory size is
much larger than past products.

00:09:34.930 --> 00:09:42.670
Two, we have a 2x ratio,
640 of GPU memory and 2x

00:09:42.670 --> 00:09:44.280
