for this configuration.

00:10:00.150 --> 00:10:01.460
We didn't stop there.

00:10:01.460 --> 00:10:03.610
We took NVIDIA's
NVLink 3 technology

00:10:03.610 --> 00:10:06.920
and made GPU-to-CPU
communication ultra fast,

00:10:06.920 --> 00:10:08.900
