00:18:07.530 --> 00:18:11.960
In the old world, Spark 2.0,
it would be a CPU cluster.

00:18:11.960 --> 00:18:17.190
You'd pipe a bunch of data in,
you would process that data,

00:18:17.190 --> 00:18:21.080
format it, maybe even
remove PII information.

00:18:21.080 --> 00:18:23.690
You put it in storage,
then you would

00:18:23.690 --> 00:18:27.500
