00:18:32.422 --> 00:18:36.520
So NVIDIA and Google
worked together

00:18:36.520 --> 00:18:39.430
to help speed up
that by bringing

00:18:39.430 --> 00:18:44.930
GPU power to both model training
as well as data preparation.

00:18:44.930 --> 00:18:49.560
Spark 3.0 supports both
of this through rapids,

00:18:49.560 --> 00:18:53.300
and now Google's
Managed Service Dataproc

00:18:53.300 --> 00:18:57.270
supports Spark 3 0
clusters and all six

00:18:57.270 --> 00:18:59.490
