00:20:27.370 --> 00:20:32.560
So GCP thinks the T4, plus our
spread region availability,

00:20:32.560 --> 00:20:36.430
plus our network offers a great
global low-latency inference

00:20:36.430 --> 00:20:38.130
product.

00:20:38.130 --> 00:20:40.450
Low-latency inference
is really important

00:20:40.450 --> 00:20:42.220
because a lot of
user experiences

00:20:42.220 --> 00:20:45.640
have predictions and
AI built into that,

00:20:45.640 --> 00:20:49.560
whether you're on a mobile app
and you're interacting with AR

00:20:49.560 --> 00:20:53.350
and seeing pictures, or
if you are getting ads,

00:20:53.350 --> 00:20:55.240
and you want those
ads specifically

00:20:55.240 --> 00:20:59.260
recommended to you, or
you're using sort of game

00:20:59.260 --> 00:21:02.530
where the game has AI
intelligence built in,

00:21:02.530 --> 00:21:05.380
if it's slow and
laggy, your users

00:21:05.380 --> 00:21:08.070
aren't going to want that.

00:21:08.070 --> 00:21:11.720
So the T4 has ultra low
latency for inference, just 1

00:21:11.720 --> 00:21:13.310
